3395:  *
3396:  *  The NaN class is #305's: exponent all-ones is part of the splice case, so a
3397:  *  NaN's sign and top-23 payload must survive.  The shared store canonicalizes
3398:  *  every NaN to 0x7fffffff instead -- sign and payload both lost (measured).
3399:  *  Note what the letter does here and this code faithfully repeats: a NaN whose
3400:  *  payload lives entirely in the discarded low bits splices to the INFINITY
3401:  *  pattern.  That is the extraction working as specified, not a case to repair,
3402:  *  and there is a gate row asserting exactly that byte.  Quieting belongs to
