1345: 	    registered window ever grew, THAT out-of-range access would happen first
1346: 	    and this one would never get the chance.  Kept because it is correct and
1347: 	    free; the real guarantee is that memory_device_register() registers
1348: 	    exactly N_PCIC_REGS words, MEASURED max index 136 of 137 across the full
1349: 	    census plus byte/halfword/word accesses at the window's last bytes.  */
