Two important exclusions are now verified: the PMAG-JA shift is inside `#if 0`, and the ARC cache-size macros have no callers at HEAD. Conversely, the DEC21143 MII read counter can advance past its apparent limit because one branch skips the reset. I’m keeping that device finding separate from the guarded serial-ROM path.

